    "summary": "Ranged weapons on **CRYPTEK** models of yours have **[[ASSAULT]](vsdata:weapon-ability/assault)**.\n\nWhenever a **CRYPTEK** unit of yours is picked to shoot in your Shooting phase, choose one ability for its models' ranged weapons until the phase ends:\n\n- **[[ASSAULT]](vsdata:weapon-ability/assault)**\n- **[[HEAVY]](vsdata:weapon-ability/heavy)**\n- **[[IGNORES COVER]](vsdata:weapon-ability/ignores-cover)**\n- **[[ANTI-INFANTRY 3+]](vsdata:weapon-ability/anti)**\n- **[[ANTI-MOUNTED 4+]](vsdata:weapon-ability/anti)**",
